# Barks (docs/DIALOGUE.md, "Barks"): one line to a player passing within 6 m, without Talk. One a
# minute per player, one per speaker per player every 10 minutes. A bark never names a player who
# is in someone else's kit, never jokes about who eats, and never gives away anything the player
# couldn't see. `once` barks are said once a life per speaker. Each one says something real about
# the place or the moment.

conv bark.occupant.short
for occupant
when house:short & !house:died
bark
voice haven

node start
  say? promise:house.tins@here :: No tins yet? Later, then. We're good at later in this house. The shelf in the stores is cleared for them.
  say? kept:house.tins@here :: You're the one who brought the tins. The children call you the tin one now. From them, that's a compliment.
  say Mind the stores as you go by. We're on half portions this week, and we're counting every tin twice.

conv bark.occupant.died
for occupant
when house:died
bark
voice haven

node start
  say Hat off if you're coming in. We lost someone this week. The candle stays in the window till the name's read at supper.

conv bark.occupant.dusk
for occupant
when dusk & !house:died
bark
voice haven

node start
  say Light's going, love. In or out, not on the step: the door's barred at dark, and the watch won't open it twice.

conv bark.named.redhand.crew
for named:redhand
when crew & !kit:in_kit & !hunted:redhand
bark
voice redhand

node start
  say? tier:redhand>=trusted :: Oi, {crew}! Still breathing? The book's thrilled. So's the crew, they had money on you.
  say Oi, {crew}! Don't wander off. You still owe us the end of that story.

conv bark.named.redhand.toll
for named:redhand/toll_man
when !crew & !hunted:redhand
bark
voice redhand

node start
  say Toll's {toll} at the lorry, in the book, no exceptions. Don't make me say it twice. I charge for twice.

conv bark.named.bastion.shift
for named:bastion
when hour>=17 & hour<18 & !hunted:bastion
bark
voice bastion

node start
  say Shift change at half five, two minutes. Don't stand in the gateway when the relief comes through.

conv bark.named.bastion.word
for named:bastion
when setword:bastion & !kit:in_kit & !hunted:bastion
bark
once
voice bastion

node start
  say {word}. Your name came up at the roll last night. As you were.

conv bark.named.halcyon.rota
for named:halcyon
when !kit:in_kit & !hunted:halcyon
bark
voice halcyon

node start
  say? night :: Lights out at the lab is a suggestion. The incubators don't sleep, so nobody on the night shift does either.
  say Mind the sample cases on the step. They're labelled. You aren't.

conv bark.wanderer.kid
for wanderer:kid
when kidlost
bark
voice plain

node start
  say If you're going to the house with the bear on the door, I'll walk behind you. I won't be any trouble. I don't know the way from here.

conv bark.wanderer.scavenger.back
for wanderer:scavenger
when due:scav.came_back & !nmem:honest
bark
once
voice plain

node start
  say Oh. You. Back from the chemist's already? Picked clean, was it? Don't answer. Your face says it all.

conv bark.named.bastion.back
for named:bastion/sentry
when kept:sentry.road@here.visit
bark
once
voice bastion

node start
  say Road's logged as walked, with your name beside it on the board. In pencil, but it's there.
